# I speak Russian: я говорю, ты говоришь
subtitle: "Ask a Russian if they speak English, answer \"yes, a little\", and see how one verb changes its ending for я, ты, он, она and вы."
tags: ["russian","verbs","present tense","conjugation","я-ты-он-вы","speaking english"]
teaches: ["vocabulary/да-немного-po","grammar/verb-conjugation-present-tense","grammar/russian-pronouns","vocabulary/говорить-forms"]
thumb: "band \"Yes, a little\" note \"да, немного\" card purple"
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}

## I speak Russian: я говорю, ты говоришь
level: basic

    icon tom size 140 set twemoji x 130 y 430 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 130 y 320 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon masha size 140 set twemoji x 870 y 430 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 870 y 320 font_size 32 hidden true
    group speakers members ["tom","tom_name","masha","masha_name"] hidden true
    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Здра́вствуйте! Вы говори́те по-англи́йски?","gloss":"Hello! Do you speak English?"},{"by":"b","text":"Да, немно́го. А вы говори́те по-ру́сски?","gloss":"Yes, a little. And do you speak Russian?"},{"by":"a","text":"Да, немно́го!","gloss":"Yes, a little!"}] size 1.4 hidden true
    dialogue talk2 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Том, ты говори́шь по-ру́сски?","gloss":"Tom, do you speak Russian?"},{"by":"a","text":"Да! Я говорю́ по-ру́сски!","gloss":"Yes! I speak Russian!"},{"by":"b","text":"Немно́го!","gloss":"A little!"}] size 1.4 hidden true
    dialogue bye speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Спаси́бо, Ма́ша! Пока́!","gloss":"Thanks, Masha! Bye!"},{"by":"b","text":"Пока́, Том!","gloss":"Bye, Tom!"}] size 1.4 hidden true
